  D — APPLIED AS CLAIMED; P1c (7) no longer releases a localhost-only fallback. New surface: none identified.
  E — PARTIAL; bytes and characters are separated, but original bytes and assembly are not independently checkable. New surface: provenance, which the manifest now properly disclaims.
